WEBVTT

00:17:58.463 --> 00:18:01.863
Have you tried an artificial burger,
and how did you find it?

00:18:02.263 --> 00:18:08.963
Gates: Yes, I’m an investor in all these
Impossible, Beyond and various people.

00:18:08.997 --> 00:18:10.163
And I have to say,

00:18:10.197 --> 00:18:14.463
the progress in that sector
is greater than I expected.

00:18:14.497 --> 00:18:15.663
Five years ago,

00:18:15.663 --> 00:18:18.763
I would have said that is as hard
as manufacturing.

00:18:18.797 --> 00:18:23.730
Now it's very hard,
but not as hard as manufacturing.

00:18:23.730 --> 00:18:27.597
There is no Impossible Foods
of green steel

00:18:27.630 --> 00:18:29.897
and the quality is going
to keep improving.

00:18:29.930 --> 00:18:32.097
It's quite good today.